        {"id": "abtstorycopy", "elType": "container", "settings": {"width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column"}, "elements": [
          {"id": "abtstoryhead", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Built around dependable project management", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#111111"}, "elements": []},
          {"id": "abtstorytext", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Custom clothing becomes difficult when design, sourcing, sampling, production, quality control and logistics are fragmented. TShirtSwiss brings these stages into one managed process.</p><p>Our role is to simplify decision-making, set clear expectations and coordinate the details that determine whether a project arrives correctly, consistently and on time.</p>", "text_color": "#555555"}, "elements": []}
        ]}
